% arXiv processing directives.
%
% This document uses fontspec to load Linux Libertine as OpenType, which
% requires xelatex. Per arXiv's TeX Live FAQ, xelatex has been available
% as a processor option since November 2025, and fonts must be named by
% file rather than by family because arXiv registers almost nothing with
% fontconfig. paper.tex names them by file for that reason.
%
% Select xelatex as the processor during submission if it is not offered
% automatically.

paper.tex toplevelfile
